{"id":"wb-4-160","name":"白居寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"白居寺","text":"白居寺，藏语称“班廓曲德”（藏语：དཔལ་ཆོས་དགོན།，威利转写：dpal 'khor chos sde），位于中国西藏自治区日喀则市江孜县江孜镇，是一座藏传佛教萨迦派、夏鲁派、格鲁派共存的寺院。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E5%B1%85%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94996476,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94996476","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8b30dcbe4ba6d08a131f3251.jpg","title":"IMG_1800_Gyantze_Kum_Bum_Palkhor_Choide.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:IMG_1800_Gyantze_Kum_Bum_Palkhor_Choide.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/IMG_1800_Gyantze_Kum_Bum_Palkhor_Choide.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Luca Galuzzi (Lucag)","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5","caption":"The Kumbum of the Palcho Monastery, Gyantse, Tibet","width":320,"height":213}}